<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Any amount set forth in Appendix I is evidence only of the status of
the Taizhou Muchi Investment Assets as of the stated date and shall not limit the scope of the Taizhou Muchi Investment Assets transferred
under Section 2.1. Any additional amount, property or right generated, accrued or payable before or after the stated date and attributable
to the relevant investments shall be included in the Taizhou Muchi Investment Assets in accordance with Section 2.1.</P>

